{
  "title": "3D变换方法",
  "definition": "教材列出的常见 3D 变换方法包括三维旋转、移动和缩放。旋转有 rotate3d、rotateX、rotateY、rotateZ；移动有 translate3d、translateX、translateY、translateZ；缩放有 scale3d、scaleX、scaleY、scaleZ。",
  "key_points": [
